{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_03_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_03","title":"7:22P.M.","storyCode":"CB-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"422c5c7edc68d0593a8063f57c177f6fd8d86f291360f9c681f4f74d4741f17d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拜松與莫斯提馬路過了一家糖果店，卻也在此時被黑手黨盯上。為了順利擺脫追蹤，拜松跳上了貨船，莫斯提馬卻不知所蹤。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——都這個時間了......趕緊回去睡覺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，如果在這裡開個海鮮攤，這客流量可真不得了啊。唔？那是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"喂~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"休想得逞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，是我啊，放手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛，你怎麼在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......收攤回家的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你在這裡發呆——不對，立刻就能反手擒拿好像也不算在發呆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽說剛才在交流道上發生的車禍了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是應該在複習功課嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"勞逸結合，不然明天拿到試卷的時候腦袋一白就完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才好像聽客人提到過，但願沒有傷亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但我在事務所聽說，這件事和一群不乾不淨的傢伙有關係......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"先說好，我絕對和什麼殺手、幫派之類的沒有關係，你知道的對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你的事情大家早就清楚了——不如說你總是這副態度，不被懷疑才奇怪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......是喔，難怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"而且兩個小時前還在龍門邊郊的高速公路上發生了一起瓦斯爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"高速公路上，瓦斯爆炸？這個理由也太濫用了點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。你該不會想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了嘛，勞逸結合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"但這算勞還是逸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了吧，再怎麼說這裡也是市中心，他們不可能行動自如。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才點的是抹茶口味的？那這份是你的，我請客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"的確沒看見什麼可疑的傢伙，可......我們是不是太悠閒了點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼話，這可是五星推薦，比黑手黨厲害多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你能聯繫得到德克薩斯他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不能，事出突然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，那就更不著急了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你的霜淇淋要化了喔，別這麼緊張兮兮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我只是......誰能料到事情會變成現在這樣。我是應該冷靜一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"黑手黨們千里迢迢從敘拉古來到龍門，總不會只是為了參加安魂節狂歡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們有別的目的，其中之一，是我。但是更具體的，我還不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"敵明我暗，既然已經擺脫了追擊，應該利用單獨行動的優勢調查事態的因果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們該怎麼入手？應該找機會進行反追蹤嗎？不，還是應該優先和德克薩斯小姐取得聯繫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，比起德克薩斯他們，你倒是更像個普通的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，突然就開始自說自話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你說的沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我們都知道黑手黨另有目的，的確不該輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是偶爾也要相信一下德克薩斯她們，別看他們總是那樣，企鵝物流可是很強的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然用“強”來形容一個物流公司有點奇怪，嗯......算啦，反正我也沒資格抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們一邊逛街，一邊看看風景，等見到德克薩斯的時候，他們已經把敵人一網打盡了喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"看見那家糖果店了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"與其說店，更像一個攤鋪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，有些年頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年前我剛來龍門的時候就來過這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候呀......身上也沒有龍門幣，說實話，灰頭土臉的，倒是一眼就被糖果吸引了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是......這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是單純的長途跋涉，路上遇到了一點小麻煩。信使都是這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇！是彩色的星星！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，你為什麼能把星星摘下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是秘密了，可不能隨隨便便告訴你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這哪裡是星星，不就是加了色素的水果糖嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，可是這麼好看的糖果真的很少見誒......你不想要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"囉、囉嗦！喂！有棉花糖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有，怎麼沒有，來，伸手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誒——但比起這點棉花糖，我還是想要那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭吃水果糖！太甜了！而且舌頭會變成奇怪的顏色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想要的話就一併拿去吧，難得的安魂夜，就不收你們錢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了，趕緊回家睡覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝爺爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別鞠躬啦！快去那邊的玩具店看看！安魂夜限定騎士哎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在的孩子們真有活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們也要買點什麼嗎？維多利亞進口的水果軟糖，附贈安魂夜蠟燭裝飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不著急，老先生。長夜漫漫，今晚才剛剛開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，說的也是。你們這樣的年輕人，一定會去參加鬧市狂歡的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（莫斯提馬小姐，這位是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......老先生也會參加今晚的活動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能呢，我已經是把老骨頭了，但我的糖果會代替我參加的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"今年的狂歡盛典很特別嗎？似乎還有一些外賓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市在先前的歲月裡沉寂太久了，人們的確需要一個像樣的狂歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是狂歡，有更多的客人參與進來，發生各種各樣的事情，不是也很有趣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜本來就是為了送走那些亡魂，活著的人能夠開開心心，就是最好的祭奠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的不買點什麼嗎？當年你可是在櫥窗外頭看入神了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你還記得，真有點不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怎麼記不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"可是很遺憾，工作之前吃太多甜食可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......那一路走好，年輕人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了有空回來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"狂歡嗎，號稱是龍門這麼多年來最盛大的一次節日活動呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......拜松？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我在想事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"在這種情況下，你會想到什麼顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你太喜歡思考了，偶爾也要以直覺行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺......莫斯提馬小姐這樣的信使，也會相信直覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"更確切地來說，是隨機應變吧。比如，我們現在正站在橋上，而下面有通行的小貨船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，前後各有三名喬裝打扮好的黑手黨成員，正在慢慢向我們靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"想偽裝已經遲了，他們早就盯上我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"從剛才的糖果鋪那裡開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們被包圍了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近都是遊客，我們不能在這裡大打出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是很遺憾，對方似乎沒有這種顧慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"跳下去，現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"從橋上——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說你太喜歡思考了，跳過柵欄，縱身一躍，就這樣——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"噗哈！總覺得今天不是第一次自由落體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......糖果？為什麼要用船運糖果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們總算甩開他們了，莫斯提馬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
